  (text "1 Input: dock (LEMO)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 3.81 3.81) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70b0cb5e-c9d7-5a83-8cc3-5f30b5fc4ab3"))
  (text "The LEMO is the only power input: the dock, or a separate USB-C PD to LEMO charging dongle at home." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "726f8ef1-352b-5ed1-a445-019ba4018bd7"))
  (text "Unused refs: J1, U1, D1, R1, C1, Q1-Q4, R34 (an earlier USB-C input), J4 and everything on U2 (the charger board)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "73c108ea-1a2c-5cb8-ae37-b46da287e6de"))
  (text "Dock: the LEMO 1K.308 sits in the enclosure wall and is wired to this board: J2 (XT30) takes its battery" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cd74e079-85fe-5eea-9440-fe0ef2d37d96"))
  (text "pins (LEMO 1-3 +, 4-6 ground), J7 (JST-PH 3) its data (LEMO 7, UART to the base), dock detect (8) and a ground." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 57.15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d3a7c511-db3e-513f-95f3-f1727f1e23ec"))
  (text "TVS: SMBJ18A on the dock input (16.8 V max), clamping under the 30 V FETs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ada12ee1-2576-53cc-b611-9e35cc62dd55"))
  (text "U9/Q9: ideal diode right after the LEMO, so no current ever leaves the shark through it (the pack, the charger," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "38c72099-7cf6-5c42-9d93-67ac96522acb"))
  (text "or plan B's USB-C modules feeding back into the dock). U3/Q5 on sheet 2 is the dock's separate OR diode into" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2347afd0-3ab8-5b49-acb9-7ba6ccceb8f9"))
  (text "the lights: without it, the pack would feed the charger's input through LIGHT_BUS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0d267b6-a5d8-5eb2-a920-634501f3a7bb"))
  (text "J8: a panel LED (with leads, no resistor) lit whenever the dock supplies power, firmware or not (~1-2 mA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c2114b6d-c558-59cc-a412-29bbb4bb3431"))
